# Test allocation

- Read `docs/testing/SEPA-PAYMENT-TEST-ALLOCATION-MATRIX.md`.
- One behavior has one primary test layer.
- Add a secondary layer only when it proves a different risk.
- Use Testcontainers for backend integration dependencies.
- Use Dagger for composed runtime proof.
- Use Playwright only for browser, session, and admitted actor-journey wiring.
- Do not duplicate backend validation cases in browser tests.
- Never claim a test passed unless the exact command ran successfully.